  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 400°F.",
    "In a 9x13 in casserole dish, toss the onions and sun-dried tomatoes with the paprika, salt, pepper and dried parsley.",
    "Set the garlic head in the middle and drizzle everything with the oil. Cover tightly with foil.",
    "Roast 1 hr, tossing halfway, until the onions are soft, jammy and caramelized.",
    "About 20 minutes before the onions are done, cook the pasta in salted water according to the package, reserving up to 1 cup of pasta water.",
    "Lift out the garlic and, when cool enough to handle, squeeze the cloves into the dish. Stir in the parsley, basil, lemon juice, coconut milk and pasta, loosening with pasta water as needed."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "Foil lets the onions go soft and jammy without burning. Vegan."
